| logical_plan  | Projection: sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * lineitem.l_discount) AS revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   Aggregate: groupBy=[[]], aggr=[[sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * lineitem.l_discount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |     Projection: lineitem.l_discount, lineitem.l_extendedprice                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |       Filter: lineitem.l_discount >= Decimal128(0.050000,18,6) AND lineitem.l_discount <= Decimal128(0.070000,18,6) AND lineitem.l_quantity < Decimal128(24.000000,18,6)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |         TableScan: lineitem projection=[l_discount, l_extendedprice, l_quantity], full_filters=[lineitem.l_shipdate >= Date32("1994-01-01"), lineitem.l_shipdate < Date32("1995-01-01")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
